<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家玄関.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "環境音\テレビの声.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door1_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"So you really weren't alone."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> in tow, I went into the house.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The lights in the house were on.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">So </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> really had come home.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I'm hooome."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No answer came from inside.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But, the sound of the TV was coming from the living room.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Sorry to intrude..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> said her greeting in a small voice.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\呪殺編\嘔吐\桃子横顔.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">When I </STYLE><STYLE ID="4" RUBY="のぞ">peeked</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> into the living room, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was lounging limply on the sofa.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I got the feeling her hair color had changed again.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I'm home."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I greeted </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> flatly.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\呪殺編\嘔吐\横顔こっち.gal" "REPEAT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\呪殺編\嘔吐\桃子横顔.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, huh."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> answered insolently.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Barely into high school and already staying out at night, huh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, you're never home either..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I'm already 20, so."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Ever since high school, you've never been home..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I quit high school right away, so."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> answered curtly, her face still turned to the TV.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">We exchange words for the first time in ages, and it's always like this.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> dropped out in her first year of high school, and ever since, she seems to just drift around having fun.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">She's a little like a delinquent, and scary.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Rather than dislike her, I just can't handle her.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">She doesn't seem to have had any trouble with the police yet, but how long will she keep this up?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I brought a </STYLE>friend<STYLE ID="3"> over."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Um... excuse me. Sorry to intrude."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> poked her head out from beside me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Ah, sorry for looking like this. There's nothing much in this house, but please make yourself at home."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> responded in a suddenly friendly voice.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I figured that whole exchange just now had been heard loud and clear by </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1">, but...</STYLE>
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "232" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Let's go."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Was she feeling uncomfortable after that unseemly exchange between us sisters...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> I pulled by the hand as I climbed the stairs.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島の部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Once in my room, I sat </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> down on the bed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="3">, if you're tired, tomorrow is fine too, okay?</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">You can just stay the night like this."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"There's no time..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">True, it's a fact that we can't let our guard down until April 8 is over.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">From here on, I have to put my all into it too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">Okay, Operation, phase two: start.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Understood. Then, please tell me the things you think you can talk about, just as they come to you. You don't have to force them into order."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> nodded silently.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Oh, I'm sorry, </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="3">. Let me ask you one thing. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">You said there's no time, but how much time is left?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Any minute now, <STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE> might die... 
{PAUSE ""}
But if she can hold out until midnight..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">When I looked at the clock, it was now 20:50. A little over 3 hours left.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">As soon as I possibly can, I have to clear up </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1">'s fixed idea.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">For that, getting information that could be a clue out of </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1"> as fast as possible is part of the Operation too.</STYLE><PG>
"Um... listen... 
{PAUSE ""}
You probably won't believe this, but..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> slowly began to speak.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I listened without taking my eyes off </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">'s face as she prefaced it once more.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"I... Me, I... 
{PAUSE ""}
I cast a curse..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"A curse..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"A curse...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"A curse..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"That kind of curse?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That kind of curse..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The strange back-and-forth went on.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "残滓念.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\呪いイメージ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">―A curse.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In this case, it probably means deliberately killing the other person by some fantastical means.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But, something like that... there's no way curses exist.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\魔女狩りイメージ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">In the old days, apparently there were things like witch hunts and black magic, but in this day and age you never hear of them at all.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even where they exist, at most they're cultural heritage, or material for made-up stories.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">It would be easy to deny curses completely with logic.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But if I deny this so-called curse here, it could turn into an unexpected loss of time.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I should probably avoid arguing back as much as I can.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I have to nod along and ask questions well, so I can draw out the information I need in the shortest time.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島の部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"That curse, </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="3">, you're the one who cast it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">So that no emotion would get into the question, I adjusted my </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="こわいろ">tone of voice</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">But when I said that, </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> fell silent again.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I rubbed </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">'s back.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"You don't have to say the things you don't want to say. Just say the things you can say, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Then, </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> let out a big breath.</STYLE><PG>
"The first time I cursed someone to death was in a place called Megasawa City, where I lived 10 years ago... 
{PAUSE ""}
I just... couldn't bear it anymore."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Megasawa City...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Megasawa City... Where the Megasawa City case happened, that one?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">In the first place, the reason I'd wanted to investigate this incident was that I was bothered by a possible link to the incidents that happen every few years in this Megasawa City.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If I remember right, I had a memo about it somewhere.</STYLE>
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "7" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No, first I'll listen to what </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> has to say.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I see... That must have been hard."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I more or less understood the story.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Some kind of trouble had happened in Megasawa City.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1">, unable to bear it, had put a curse on the person at the root of it; that must be what she meant.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But 10 years ago... </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1"> herself would have only just started elementary school then, I'd think...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Well, </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">'s curse and the Megasawa City case are probably separate matters.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But 10 years ago was exactly the year the first Megasawa City case happened.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And the April 8 that </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> is so worried about is also the date the Megasawa City case happens on.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">No way... That can't be.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">First, I'll hear her out without preconceptions.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"In this incident too, </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="3">, did you put a curse on </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and the others?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Probably... I think I cast it."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Probably, huh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">What a vague answer.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If she'd flatly declared it here, I could have asked, "Is there no way to lift it?" but...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">No, if it could be lifted in the first place, there'd be no need to come to me for advice.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In other words, there's no way to lift it.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"What do you mean by 'probably'?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">When I asked, </STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\paper-round1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> took several sheets of paper out of her pocket.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The crumpled sheets were being spread open by </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">There were three sheets, with writing on them.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And, they were oddly shaped pieces of paper.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "death_sound1.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
