<STYLE ID="3">"Paper dolls... are they?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">On the human-shaped paper were written the names of the three members of the Kogori family.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8" RUBY="りょうじ">Ryoji</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> Kogori</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Senpai's father</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10" RUBY="あかね">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> Kogori</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Senpai's mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And... </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi Kogori</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">I see, so a person whose name is written on these paper dolls dies.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But, the odd stains all over them bother me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Stains, or gunk, or whatever it was, they were pretty filthy.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="3">, so this is how you cursed someone to death 10 years ago."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"When I saw these this morning, I was really scared. 
{PAUSE ""}
While I was asleep, I did it without knowing, I'm sure..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">So the dolls were made sometime between last night and this morning.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> had these on her now was probably because she'd meant to show them to the police.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But, this paper-doll curse has one big contradiction.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Once she hears it, </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> should realize this is a sham.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But, it'd probably be better not to let a smile show yet.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"But, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kogori-senpai's father</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> lied yesterday evening that he was going on a business trip, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　So as of yesterday evening, the incident was already about to happen. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">In other words, if you think about the timing, doesn't that mean the paper dolls were added after the fact?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
