<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n300\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> pinched the edge of a paper doll and lifted it up.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh? Um..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I came back to myself and tried to answer </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">'s question, but her look cowed me and the words wouldn't come out right.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Not that I even knew what the stuff on the surface was in the first place.</STYLE><PG>
"This is something I brought up."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Brought up?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">'Bring up' gets used to mean all sorts of things, but if it means exactly what it says―</STYLE><PG>
"If you smear what you ate and brought up from your stomach onto a paper doll, the curse is complete. 
{PAUSE ""}
From then on, nothing you do can undo it."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A chill ran through me. So in other words, </STYLE><STYLE ID="13" RUBY="としゃぶつ">vomit</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">, half asleep, made paper dolls, wrote names, vomited, smeared it on, and went back to sleep, is what she's saying?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Something's off...! That's way too convenient!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Sticking a finger down your throat might make you vomit, but then you'd surely wake up.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"S-</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="3">? If you threw up, surely you'd come fully awake..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1"> wouldn't change that eerie look.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hahaha... Hey now... and they call you a <STYLE ID="3">genius girl</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
What you and I talked about yesterday at the food stall in the park, you forgot?
{PAUSE ""}
　Up until the day before, I was puking like crazy from food poisoning, remember?
{PAUSE ""}
　So it's no surprise if one last round came up out of nowhere last night, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Of course I remembered that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But...</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="7">Natsumi's dad</STYLE> got in touch in the evening about a business trip?
{PAUSE ""}
　So what? He just happened to have some other errand, right?
{PAUSE ""}
　Come on, how can you say for sure that the business-trip lie leads to murder? Say it, then!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Th-that's... true... but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But, even so, it's too much of a coincidence..."</STYLE><PG>
"Me, every year when April 8 gets close, my stomach always goes bad, and I throw up and get the runs... 
{PAUSE ""}
I'm sure the shinigami's been waiting and longing... for the witch's curse!
{PAUSE ""}
　My dad, who became a shinigami, is granting my wish!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">What on earth is </STYLE>this person<STYLE ID="1"> saying...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">One after another, she was lining up eerie words that made no sense.</STYLE><PG>
Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1">'s father, a shinigami?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Does she mean </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1">'s father, who's supposed to be dead, is the culprit?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That kind of thing... that kind of thing, it's impossible...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A dead person committing murder!</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But, from what </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> just said, one thing had become clear.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1"> blindly believes in this thing called a curse.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Somewhere in her heart, she must be satisfied that the curse came true, like today.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">So trying to persuade her about the curse with logic is pointless.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I have to open the subject from a different angle...!</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"S-</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="3">, can I ask you something weird?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Before speaking, I left a pause.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"The one who made these..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Pausing once more―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"The one who made these, wasn't it </STYLE><STYLE ID="14">Senpai's mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">?"</STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">This question of mine should strike right at the heart of it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A motive of </STYLE><STYLE ID="15" RUBY="ふくしゅう">revenge</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> on the Kogori family, and the fact that </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="16"> herself</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> seems deeply involved in this incident.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That being so, the only one I can think of who set this up is </STYLE><STYLE ID="14">Senpai's mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> seemed to be thinking it over vacantly, but...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島の部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
