{PLAYSND "見えない光_2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
"No, that's not it... 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="14">Mom</STYLE> shouldn't know about my curse. 
{PAUSE ""}
I've kept it hidden all along, and I wouldn't want even a <STYLE ID="14">parent</STYLE> to see something like this."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Senpai<STYLE ID="1">'s expression, completely changed from that earlier look, had gone blank.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"But if you live together, it wouldn't be strange for her to know..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="3">You</STYLE>'re right about that. 
{PAUSE ""}
But, when I killed those people over there, <STYLE ID="14">Mom</STYLE> and I had alibis. 
{PAUSE ""}
The police asked us all kinds of things too. But, even though there was a motive, we had alibis, so the questioning ended fast. 
{PAUSE ""}
If <STYLE ID="14">Mom</STYLE> isn't the culprit, there's no point in her making paper dolls."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">True...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The Japanese police aren't stupid either.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If someone killed a person, they'd come to arrest them right away, without missing even the most </STYLE><STYLE ID="17" RUBY="ささい">trivial</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> piece of information.</STYLE><PG>
"Besides, it wasn't just one person I killed in Megasawa. 
{PAUSE ""}
It was six."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Six...!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1"> had killed as many as six people and still hadn't been caught by the police.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Besides, she'd just said she had a motive and was questioned by the police, so there must be no evidence at all that </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> killed anyone.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">As I thought, it's a stretch to believe that </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> cursed them to death.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even if she says she cursed them to death, if that were certain, the police would </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="にら">suspect</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> there had to be some trick.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But judging from all this, far from solving it, </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> must have been dropped from the suspects right away.</STYLE><PG>
"The Megasawa City case, you know about it, right? The culprit is me. Because it's a curse, I'll never get caught."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I see: two people killed each time, and three incidents so far.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">So, she killed six people, then.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In fact, there are quite a few people who call the Megasawa City case a curse or a spiriting-away.</STYLE>
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "23" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
"I killed two each time. If you say <STYLE ID="14">Mom</STYLE> killed that many, she'd get caught for sure, wouldn't she?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> of all people should get that much, was what her tone all but said.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">I was at a loss. How could I put </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> at ease?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I had no more information that could persuade her, logic aside.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If this really was a curse, there were certainly a lot of things that added up.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">What is it, this feeling that something's off? Something's nagging at me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I feel like I'm overlooking something, something important.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">What is it... If I could just notice it...</STYLE><PG>
