<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Senpaaai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, can you hear me!? It's </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> Goto!"</STYLE>
