{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Then </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1"> switched the phone to speakerphone for me.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Hello? </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">? Are you with </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="5">, at </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">'s house?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">From the sound of her voice, she seemed to have calmed down somewhat.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"That's right. </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, are you out of the police station?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Yeah, they said the questioning's over for today. </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> and I are getting a ride home from the police."</STYLE>
