Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1"> seems happy to hear her voice, but this shouldn't be a situation where we can relax yet.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Senpaaai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. Is it okay if I come over there with </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="3"> now?"</STYLE>
