{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">On the other end of the line, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> seemed to be asking her </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
